Description: FellowshipNAS home server role
 Everything the FellowshipNAS role needs: ZFS and its tools, traditional RAID
 with mdadm and XFS, NFS sharing, snapshots, backups, health alerts, and a check
 that keeps the system on a kernel with a working ZFS module.
